---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
import { site } from "@/data/site";
---

<Layout
  title="About"
  description="Dino’s Lab is an independent hardware studio in Ladispoli, near Rome, with a production agreement at Acme Systems."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6">
    <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-lab">About</p>
    <h1 class="mt-2 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight">A small studio, a real line.</h1>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted">
      <p>
        Dino’s Lab is an independent hardware studio in Ladispoli, in the Rome
        area. We design printed circuit boards and modules, write firmware, and
        build the software that sits around the hardware.
      </p>
      <p>
        We are not a large house with a names-on-the-door roster. The studio
        collaborates with professionals in software, hardware, firmware, and
        mechanics as each project needs them.
      </p>
      <p>
        Production is the part most design shops outsource to a distant fab.
        We have a production agreement with{" "}
        <a class="text-lab underline decoration-line underline-offset-2" href={site.acme.url}>
          {site.acme.name}
        </a>
        , also in Ladispoli. Their line — pick-and-place, vapour-phase reflow,
        through-hole, test — is the same one behind their own System-on-Module
        products, including the RoadRunner. We use it for Dino’s Lab boards:
        prototypes, small series, and runs of tens of thousands in a month.
      </p>
      <p>
        The catalog is the long game. Custom work is how we start. We speak
        English and take work from anywhere.
      </p>
    </div>

    <dl class="mt-12 grid gap-6 border-t border-line pt-10 sm:grid-cols-2">
      <div>
        <dt class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-muted">Studio</dt>
        <dd class="mt-1">{site.location}</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-muted">Production</dt>
        <dd class="mt-1">{site.acme.name}, Ladispoli</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-muted">GitHub</dt>
        <dd class="mt-1">
          <a class="text-lab hover:underline" href={site.github}>{site.githubHandle}</a>
        </dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-muted">Contact</dt>
        <dd class="mt-1">
          <a class="text-lab hover:underline" href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>
        </dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
  </div>
</Layout>
